WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.750
Here's Director's Lookbook in under a minute.

00:02.800 --> 00:04.110
Say the feeling.

00:04.160 --> 00:06.110
Rainy cafe at night.

00:06.160 --> 00:07.150
Get the look.

00:07.200 --> 00:12.350
A camera, a light, a film stock and a palette, each with the name directors use.

00:12.400 --> 00:13.790
Not sure about one card?

00:13.840 --> 00:14.750
Tap New.

00:14.800 --> 00:16.190
Liked the last one better?

00:16.240 --> 00:17.150
Tap back.

00:17.200 --> 00:20.590
Copy the prompt, and paste it into your image or video tool.

00:20.640 --> 00:21.630
Just browsing?

