Open a cheat sheet.

00:22.800 --> 00:27.950
Camera shots, lighting, poses, fonts, music, each with a picture.

00:28.000 --> 00:30.270
Tap the ones you like, and add them to your look.

00:30.320 --> 00:31.870
Or scroll the library.

00:31.920 --> 00:33.870
Every card shows an example.

00:33.920 --> 00:35.310
Director's Lookbook.

00:35.360 --> 00:36.510
Say the feeling.

00:36.560 --> 00:38.070
